---
description: Color extraction and contrast management for dynamic UI theming
globs: /src/color-manager.ts,/src/utils.ts
alwaysApply: false
---
Color Management System:

1. Color Extraction (@color-manager.ts):
   - Uses ColorThief to extract palettes from effect images
   - Extracts background, text, and accent colors
   - Handles image loading and extraction gracefully
   - Returns consistent RGB color format

2. Color Processing (@utils.ts):
   - Ensures WCAG AA compliance (4.5:1 contrast)
   - Functions: getAccessibleTextColors, ensureContrastLab
   - Uses chroma.js for color manipulation
   - Handles edge cases and fallbacks

3. Implementation Notes:
   - Process images asynchronously
   - Cache results when possible
   - Provide fallbacks for failed extractions
   - Support both RGB array and string formats

The color system dynamically adapts the UI based on extracted colors while ensuring readability and accessibility.